<title>UK: Airbus wins Asiana A321 order.</title>
<headline>Airbus wins Asiana A321 order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airbus Industrie said on Tuesday it had won an order from South Korean shorthaul carrier Asiana for 18 A321 aircraft.  </p>
<p>Airbus senior vice president John Leahy told reporters the deal with Asiana was signed earlier on Tuesday in Toulouse.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Farnborough Newsroom +(44) 1252 519141 extension 2053</p>
